!! An overdue area

```
title: $:/config/rimir/work-focus/areas/overdue
tags: $:/tags/rimir/work-focus/area
caption: Overdue
wf.level: alert
wf.date-field: due-date
wf.info: date-relative field:parent
wf.when-past: overdue <<n>>d
wf.filter: [has[due-date]!has[completed-date]] :filter[get[due-date]wf-days[]compare:integer:lt[0]]
```

`wf.info` lists the parts shown under each item: `date-relative`, `date-relative:<field>` (another date field, worded by `wf.when-past.<field>` etc., e.g. `wf.when-future.due-date: due in <<n>>d`), `modified-ago` and `field:<name>`. Several areas can share a tab (`wf.tab`).

!! Status area and a "Done" action

An action that only exists where it makes sense. `<area>` is the area tiddler's title.

```
title: $:/config/rimir/work-focus/actions/done
tags: $:/tags/rimir/work-focus/action
caption: Done
wf.group: status
wf.icon: ✓
wf.filter: [<area>!match[$:/config/rimir/work-focus/areas/plan]]
wf.mark: ✓ done

<$action-setfield $tiddler=<<item>> completed-date={{{ [wf-date[today]] }}}/>
```

!! Your own tiles

Tile values come from `wf.tiles`, a filter. Values with `+` or `-` must be bracketed.

```
wf.tiles: [[today]] [[+1d]] [[+3d]] [[mon]]
```

!! Set a field with the shipped recipe

```
title: $:/config/rimir/work-focus/actions/waiting
tags: $:/tags/rimir/work-focus/action
caption: Waiting
wf.group: status
wf.recipe: set-field
wf.field: status
wf.value: waiting
```

!! Replace a shipped action

Make a tiddler with the same title as the shipped one, e.g. `$:/plugins/rimir/work-focus/actions/day-strip`. Yours wins over the plugin's shadow. To hide one, set `wf.hidden: yes`; to replace it by another action, name it in that action's `wf.replaces`.

